     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In a regulation, «ただし» usually introduces an exception or condition that modifies the previous rule.",
     "texto": [
      "Read the rule first and then the exception; the exception may limit who, when or how the rule applies. Pay attention to dates and quantities.",
      "しりょうしつ は ごご 八時 まで 利用 できます。ただし、土曜日 は 五時 に 閉まります。 (The reading room can be used until eight in the evening. However, on Saturdays it closes at five.)",
